The TWINE name, logos, logomark, logotype and the other visual identity
assets in this repository (the "Brand Assets") are the property of the
TWINE Consortium. They are not released under an open-source or Creative
Commons licence.

Permitted use
-------------
Consortium partners, the European Commission and its agencies, the press
and other third parties may use the Brand Assets, unmodified, only to
refer to the TWINE project, its results and its activities, in line with
the TWINE Brand Guidelines (guidelines/twine-brand-guidelines-2026.pdf).

Not permitted
-------------
- Modifying, distorting, recolouring or recombining the Brand Assets.
- Separating the logomark, the logotype and the tagline other than as
  provided by the official logo variants.
- Using the Brand Assets in a way that suggests endorsement by the TWINE
  Consortium without its prior written consent.
- Using the Brand Assets as, or as part of, another trademark, logo or
  product name.

For any other use, contact the TWINE Consortium at info@twine-project.eu.

TWINE has received funding from the European Union's Horizon Europe
research and innovation programme under grant agreement No 101298722.
